#
# The corpus generators, as build targets. Each writes the sources, the
# BUILD file and the truth of one tier into //hdl/corpus:
#
#     bazel run //tools/corpus/gen_t67
#
# They write into the source tree on purpose: a corpus case is checked
# in, so that a database can be rebuilt from the same sources tomorrow.
# Running every one of them and then `git status hdl/corpus` is the
# check that a generator still writes the cases it is supposed to.
